  "term": "DST",
  "definition": "DST means digital screen time: the amount of time a person spends in front of electronic device screens. It includes screen use on devices such as smartphones, tablets, computers, television, and video games for activities like communication, social media, gaming, streaming, online learning, and meetings.",
